feration of Osteosarcoma Cells by the Novel Tyrosine Kinase Inhibitor STI571</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>3584</fpage><lpage>3591</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12429650</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Krystal</surname><given-names>GW</given-names></name><name><surname>Honsawek</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Litz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchdunger</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The selective tyrosine kinase inhibitor STI571 inhibits small cell lung cancer growth</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>2000</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>3319</fpage><lpage>3326</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10955819</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esposito</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Kleeff</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Bischoff</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Fischer</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Collecchi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Iorio</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bevilacqua</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchler</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Friess</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The stem cell factor-c-kit system and mast cells in human pancreatic cancer</article-title><source>Lab Invest</source><year>2002</year><volume>82</volume><fpage>1481</fpage><lpage>1492</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12429808</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wa